Hi3D v1.0 (Sparc3D) in inference.rs
===================================

The files in this folder reimplement in Rust the Hi3D v1.0 second-stage inference code (the Python package
`sparc3d`, https://github.com/hi3d-official/Hi3Dv1.0) and run its model files
(https://huggingface.co/hi3d-official/Hi3Dv1.0). Modified: the pipeline, transformer, sparse VAE decoder, sampler,
mesh voxelizer, FlexiCubes extraction and hole filling were rewritten in Rust for this engine; the final mesh is
simplified with the engine's own edge-collapse simplifier instead of pyfqmr. This port is not an official Hi3D product
and is not endorsed by OCEANO HK HOLDING LIMITED.

